        "original_id": "9bd3e95e-e58f-5d0f-babe-9b723f47bd3c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Stith Pemberton, Angelo Mariani\n- Products: Coca-Cola, coca wine, cola\n- Roles: pharmacists\n\nFacts:\n- In 1863, pharmacist Angelo Mariani created coca wine.\n- In 1886, pharmacist John Stith Pemberton invented Coca-Cola.\n- John Stith Pemberton's non-alcoholic Coca-Cola recipe was inspired by Angelo Mariani's coca wine.\n- Colas became popular worldwide after John Stith Pemberton invented Coca-Cola.\n- John Stith Pemberton was born on July 8, 1831, and died on August 16, 1888.\n- John Stith Pemberton was an American pharmacist and the founder of Coca-Cola.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
